{"id":"x6n2j1r7qvbikfak4fturyhkf","title":"车企自研芯片开始外供，能否打开新市场？","originalTitle":null,"summary":"蔚来、理想和小鹏等车企开始推出自研芯片，并尝试对外销售。理想汽车完成16.25亿元融资，计划推动相关产品向外部客户供应。这些芯片在智能驾驶计算、ISP图像处理和AI大模型计算等方面具备优势，但车企需面对技术信任、数据安全和专业芯片厂商的竞争等挑战。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15327069.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T09:45:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T10:25:06.324Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T10:25:06.324Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(半导体产业纵横)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}